{
 "name": "AgentKit · 02 — Content Repurposer",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "21fcbf25-0bc7-469b-bb3c-3bf4024f0355",
   "name": "📌 SETUP GUIDE",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    180,
    60
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "color": 4,
    "content": "## ⚡ AgentKit · 02 — Content Repurposer\n**Telegram pe `/repurpose <topic>` likho → 4 platforms ka content pack wapas.**\n\n**Setup (10 min):**\n1. **Telegram bot** — @BotFather token → n8n Telegram credential (Trigger + Send nodes).\n2. **AI** — CONFIG: Ollama (`http://localhost:11434/v1`) ya OpenAI. 4 AI nodes khud-ba-khud CONFIG se key/URL lete hain.\n3. **Sheets log** — Sheet banao, tab `log`. ID CONFIG mein.\n4. **Active** karo → Telegram pe bhejo: `/repurpose AI tools for small business`\n\n**Flow:** Trigger → command parse → 4 AI nodes (parallel) → pack build → Telegram → Sheets log.\n**Note:** 4 AI calls = ~30-60 sec. Sabar rakho, pack worth it hai.\n",
    "height": 700,
    "width": 620
   }
  },
  {
